      "notes": "Static-triangle object/mesh/face/vertex/corner attributes: 48 compiled graphs plus 328 typed programs; 5,088 Linux evaluations, seven rejected inputs. Derivative/bump variants, non-Rec709 color conversion, negative offsets and 64-bit identities are CPU-compared on Linux. Plain native graphs replay on four GPUs; UV-driven complete render also passes. Other domains, general bump state, production image coverage and all native RIDs remain open; strict differences persist.",
